# Focus Timer Test Checklist

- [ ] Open http://localhost:3000/focus (Encountered connection reset, retrying...)
- [ ] Start a focus session
- [ ] Set timer to 0:01 manually
- [ ] Verify 'Need more time?' buttons appear
- [ ] Click '+15m'
- [ ] Verify timer resets to 15:00 and is running
- [ ] Verify success toast/notification
- [ ] Report UI state
